.TH WORDCOUNT 1 "September 2026" "OS Assignment" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count the number of words in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.br
.B int wordCount(const char *filename);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B wordCount
function reads the specified file and counts the number of words contained in it.
It returns the total number of words found in the file.
